category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libtommath-devel
sdesc: "Fairly comprehensive, modular and portable cryptographic toolkit (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "LibTomCrypt is a fairly comprehensive, modular and portable cryptographic
toolkit that provides developers with a vast array of well known published
block ciphers, one-way hash functions, chaining modes, pseudo-random number
generators, public key cryptography and a plethora of other routines."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/libtom/libtomcrypt
license: LicenseRef-PublicDomain OR WTFPL
